'''L'Estany Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de L'Estany}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: LES, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: LEIB) is a domestic airport serving [[L'Estany]], a lakeside resort community in [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the lake district of the interior Estret lowlands and serves the surrounding resort areas. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

